{{Noticebox/Official}}

'''Moonchaser''' is a [[VRChat]] music [[Events|event]] hosted on {{Date|2026-08-28}}.<ref name="DU2026-08-13">[https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-13-august-2026/48800 "Developer Update - 13 August 2026"] on ''ask.vrchat.com''; dated August 13, 2026; retrieved August 13, 2026.</ref>

== Format ==

The event is a party in a Moonchaser world, with DJ and performances broadcast to every instance of that world, starting at {{DateTime|2026-08-28 18:00}} PT. The world is available [[Cross-platform|cross-platform]] and will appear in a special [[Worlds#World categories|World Row]] on that date.<ref name="VRChatMoonchaserX2026-08-20">[https://x.com/VRChat/status/2090512905825345711 Post] on ''x.com''; posted August 20, 2026; retrieved August 21, 2026.</ref>

== Performers ==

VRChat listed five DJs: ClydeMachine, 3Marco_VRChat, SeraAkai, im_naku, and yoru019; and two VJs: SoftlySteph and SirRoseVR.<ref name="VRChatMoonchaserLineupX2026-08-20">[https://x.com/VRChat/status/2090512907633090814 Post] on ''x.com''; posted August 20, 2026; retrieved August 21, 2026.</ref>

== Rewards ==

A Moonchaser Penlight Twitch Drop is available for watching the official Developer stream at [https://www.twitch.tv/vrchat twitch.tv/vrchat], a Moonchaser Wristband for joining an instance, or both.<ref name="VRChatMoonchaserX2026-08-20" /> Users who stay after an hour receive a Moonchaser Shades Accessory.<ref name="VRChatMoonchaserX2026-08-20" />

== History ==

On {{Date|2026-06-22}}, VRChat opened a public interest check for performers and venues for a planned large, platform-wide event.<ref name="VRChatMusicInterestBsky">[https://bsky.app/profile/vrchat.com/post/3movpjgim422n "Music Performance Interest"] post on ''bsky.app''; posted June 22, 2026; retrieved June 22, 2026.</ref> The application form said the event would be officially promoted across VRChat's social media, video, and in-app discovery, and "broadcast beyond standard instances using streaming tech".<ref name="VRChatEventForm">[https://forms.gle/sgGRLYr6XAqhv5K89 "VRChat Event — Performer & Venue Interest"] application form on ''forms.gle''; retrieved June 22, 2026.</ref> The form described timing as still in flux, with a first event likely about one hour and pre-recorded, targeting late August or November 2026.<ref name="VRChatEventForm" />

The {{Date|2026-07-30}} Developer Update referred to an unnamed event around August's lunar eclipse.<ref name="DU2026-07-30">[https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-30-july-2026/48750 "Developer Update - 30 July 2026"] on ''ask.vrchat.com''; dated July 30, 2026; retrieved August 13, 2026.</ref> On {{Date|2026-08-07}}, a VRChat Shop post for the EDM Bundle (available until {{Date|2026-10-09}}) included a promotional video that presents the event date as {{Date|2026-08-28}}.<ref name="VRChatEDMBundleX">[https://x.com/VRChat/status/2085833362959126610 Post] on ''x.com''; posted August 7, 2026; retrieved August 8, 2026.</ref> On {{Date|2026-08-13}}, VRChat named the event Moonchaser and said it would be hosted on {{Date|2026-08-28}}.<ref name="DU2026-08-13" /> On {{Date|2026-08-20}}, VRChat posted the world, start time, lineup, World Row, and rewards on X.<ref name="VRChatMoonchaserX2026-08-20" /><ref name="VRChatMoonchaserLineupX2026-08-20" />

